            "notes": "## Powers\n\nI find that [Electro Cluster](item_2ce040d2-6b47-4be6-83b3-f8266c2c2b48) is better than [Circuit Breaker](item_ee0bd3b8-4c0d-40e6-a2a2-be20deef0e19) in most games, since the 20% more range allows you to outspace enemies you don\u2019t want to be super close to\u2014like Rein, Cass, or Reaper. It also makes it easier to pierce or reach hard-to-hit enemies like Mercy or Genji.\n\n## Items\n\n[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) and [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) are basically a 10% WP increase. [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318), because there's not much else left you can take that's useful.",
