            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Tesla Field](item_68f73d99-6d07-40f5-ad28-0c69f45487c7) is great, especially if you take [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505). We are going to take [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) R6 almost certainly either way, if we don\u2019t take it this round.\n\n[Primal Punch](item_3b024d32-8fa1-4713-80ee-e042867f5228) is the other option because it\u2019s a lot of burst when you jump.\n\n## Items\n\nIn most games, I take [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f)\u2014it's just solid damage. However, there are so many sticky enemy team comps with heroes like Moira, Brig, or JQ that [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) is better in at least half the games, especially with [Tesla Field](item_68f73d99-6d07-40f5-ad28-0c69f45487c7). This makes your jump debuff as well.\n\nThen some other options:\n\n- [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) deals slightly more damage and has a good effect, so if you can buy it, it's a good option.\n- [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) has a nice secondary effect and deals a ton of damage too. It just makes you use a lot of ammo. 20% AS is comparable to 20% WP.\n- [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) is another one of my favorites because it has a [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) built in and also comes with movement speed and 10% CDR. It\u2019s great if the enemies are hard to Primal.\n- [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) is the best tanky item and pretty cheap, so you can maybe upgrade the last green item.",
