            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-11T00:34:07.035971+00:00",
            "notes": "## Powers\n\nIn most games, I take [Primal Punch](item_3b024d32-8fa1-4713-80ee-e042867f5228) because the last powers are underwhelming.\n\n[Lunar Leap](item_dd41728d-7997-487f-93f5-859b3e9d0c84) is decent because we jump around a lot, same for [Moon Landing](item_cc4f210b-31e1-47b2-8400-325afcc4892b).\n\n[Primal Slam](item_9c54910d-33eb-4b3c-b04c-c9ac9b6f533a) takes time to get used to but is quite strong if mastered, since it\u2019s even MORE mobility and outplay potential.\n\n## Items\n\n[Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) is good since it gives the most WP we can get, and it also works on [Tesla Field](item_68f73d99-6d07-40f5-ad28-0c69f45487c7).\n\nI usually don\u2019t recommend replacing [Zero-G Suit](item_404d695a-1c12-47ac-9bc4-00b6e6e985e6), but you can try. The other item that you can maybe replace is [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f), though it's pretty hard to beat because it's basically 20% WP. This late into the game, it's hard overall with Winton in general. Personally, I like [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) late game because it adds a huge chunk of stats. [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) is easily the best tanky item late game.",
